        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-14T17:24:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oooh Katee Sackoff as Expatriette!! I like that, a lot.&nbsp;</p><p>I was kind of thinking Laura Linney as The Assistant.&nbsp;</p><p>And, lets be real, Gina Carrano is kind of the Real Life Wraith.&nbsp;</p><p>I could see Molly Quinn as the Matriarch.&nbsp;</p><p>I love the idea of Andy Serkis as AZ and Nathan Fillion as Legacy. Too perfect.&nbsp;</p>",
