        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/dc4da7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-12-14T20:23:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My daughter watches this show on Disney Channel called \"Pair of Kings.\" Geno Segers plays the Maori-ish bodyguard and advisor to the kings. His costume and personality both are essentially Haka. He even grows a beard and dons a hoodie in an episode.</p><p>Jean Claude van Damme as Ambuscade?</p>",
