        "created_at": "2012-12-16T20:58:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've got to vote Jason Momoa for Haka. Heck, the guy even did a haka as his audition tape for Game of Thrones (the good videos have all been removed from Youtube, but you can still find a couple low quality versions out there).</p><p>And as long as people are suggesting Firefly cast members for people, let's go with Summer Glau for Unity.</p>",
